@@@!atrep

@@/ at-docbook: a syntax mapper for a useful subset of DocBook.
@@/ The first *nested* std dialektos: one uniform section sim
@@/ contains its own subsections, so structure-preserving
@@/ morphisms to and from other nested dialektoi (litogramma)
@@/ need no flattening. Code maps to the core enlexis forms
@@/ (programlisting language as a genos); footnotes are inline
@@/ in DocBook and ride the deixis machinery.

@=== section
@# lemma
grammata
#@
@"section at any depth (title is the lemma); sections nest"@
===@

@=== emphasis
@/ grammata /@
@"emphasis element"@
===@

@=== strong
@* grammata *@
@"emphasis role=strong/bold"@
===@

@=== blockquote
@>
grammata
>@
@"blockquote element"@
===@

@=== note
@!
grammata
!@
@"note admonition"@
===@

@=== warning
@!!
grammata
!!@
@"warning admonition"@
===@

@=== unordered-list
@--
grammata
--@
@"itemizedlist element"@
===@

@=== ordered-list
@..
grammata
..@
@"orderedlist element"@
===@

@=== list-item
@-
grammata
-@
@"listitem element"@
===@

@=== footnote
@^
grammata
^@
@"footnote body; the callout deixis marks the anchor"@
===@
